In Glasgow, there's a couple of notable examples;

1) "The Jogging Bierhoff" - a dude who always seems to be out jogging, replete with mullet and 70's pornstache, and exclusively wears old football (soccer) tops with "Bierhoff" on the back (he was a German footballer for those who don't know).

2) "The Electric Scarecrow" - a bit of a weird guy. Wanders around all day dressed like he's just stepped out of a mid-90s warehouse rave, complete with high-vis vest, whistle, etc. When I last saw him, he had white-tipped hair. Spends much of his day riding on the buses as well.
